        {
          "id": "ca4d5750-dc04-406d-9494-174f855fda18",
          "memory": "The Friday crew planned to meet out front at Luigi's on 5th Street on October 9, 2026, with Maya taking the bus after early gym, User walking about 10 minutes from work, and Leo driving and planning to text when close, noting parking is better than Pine Street",
